; }\n  .ml-20 { margin-left: 20px; }\n  .highlight { color: #e85040; }\n  .underline { text-decoration: underline; }\n  .fraction-inline {\n    display: inline-flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    align-items: center;\n    vertical-align: middle;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    line-height: 1.2;\n  }\n  .fraction-inline .num { border-bottom: 1px solid #333; padding: 0 3px; }\n  .fraction-inline .den { padding: 0 3px; }\n  .side-note {\n    font-size: 12px;\n    color: #666;\n    margin-left: 10px;\n  }\n  .panda-icon {\n    font-size: 30px;\n    float: right;\n  }\n  .section-divider {\n    border: none;\n    border-top: 1px dashed #ccc;\n    margin: 20px 0;\n  }\n  .try-section {\n    background: #f5f5f5;\n    padding: 10px 15px;\n    border-radius: 5px;\n    margin: 10px 0;\n  }\n  .try-title {\n    font-weight: bold;\n    color: #4a3a8a;\n  }\n  .arrow-down {\n    color: #e85040;\n    font-size: 20px;\n    display: block;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n  .label-box {\n    display: inline-block;\n    background: #e8f4f8;\n    border: 1px solid #b0d4e8;\n    border-radius: 10px;\n    padding: 3px 10px;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    margin: 3px;\n  }\n  .label-box.red {\n    background: #fce4ec;\n    border-color: #f8bbd0;\n  }\n  .label-box.green {\n    background: #e8f8e8;\n    border-color: #b0d8b0;\n  }\n  .label-box.orange {\n    background: #fff3e0;\n    border-color: #ffcc80;\n  }\n  .explanation-text {\n    font-size: 13px;\n    color: #555;\n    margin: 5px 0;\n    padding-left: 15px;\n  }\n  .red-text { color: #e85040; }\n  .blue-text { color: #1976d2; }\n  .green-text { color: #388e3c; }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<div class=\"header\">\n  <div class=\"header-title\">问题解决</div>\n</div>\n\n<!-- Problem 1 -->\n<div class=\"problem-section\">\n  <div class=\"problem-title\">\n    <span class=\"problem-number\">1</span>\n    <span class=\"problem-question\">汽车已经行了多少千米？</span>\n    <span class=\"problem-hint\">求一个数的几分之几的问题</span>\n    <span class=\"arrow-red\">→</span>\n    <span class=\"hint-text\">用已知量乘分率</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Scene illustration -->\n  <div class=\"scene-container\">\n    <div class=\"mountain\"></div>\n    <div class=\"mountain2\"></div>\n    <div class=\"road\"></div>\n    <div class=\"tree\" style=\"left:20px;\">🌲</div>\n    <div class=\"tree\" style=\"left:60px;\">🌲</div>\n    <div class=\"tree\" style=\"left:100px;\">🌲</div>\n    <div class=\"tree\" style=\"left:150px;\">🌲</div>\n    <div class=\"tree\" style=\"right:200px;\">🌲</div>\n    <div class=\"tree\" style=\"right:160px;\">🌲</div>\n    <div class=\"tree\" style=\"right:120px;\">🌲</div>\n    <div class=\"car\">🚌</div>\n    <div class=\"scene-label\" style=\"bottom:70px; right:100px;\">要行84千米</div>\n    <div class=\"scene-label\" style=\"bottom:90px; right:30px;\">已经行了全程的 $\\frac{2}{3}$</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"explanation-text\">\n    \"行了全程的 $\\frac{2}{3}$\" 就是把全程看作单位\"1\"，已经行了的路程是 84km 的 $\\frac{2}{3}$。\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"flex-row\" style=\"margin: 10px 0;\">\n    <div class=\"bubble\" style=\"max-width:180px;\">\n      怎么理解\"已经行了全程的 $\\frac{2}{3}$\"？\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"flex:1; text-align:center;\">\n      <div class=\"number-line-label\">行了全程的 $\\frac{2}{3}$</div>\n      <div style=\"position:relative; width:70%; margin:0 auto; height:40px;\">\n        <div style=\"position:absolute; top:0; left:0; right:0; height:12px; border:2px solid #333; border-bottom:none; border-radius:3px 3px 0 0;\"></div>\n        <div style=\"position:absolute; top:-18px; left:0; right:33%; font-size:12px; text-align:center;\">行了全程的 $\\frac{2}{3}$</div>\n        <div style=\"position:absolute; bottom:0; left:0; right:0; height:2px; background:#333;\"></div>\n        <div style=\"position:absolute; bottom:-2px; left:0; width:2px; height:8px; background:#333;\"></div>\n        <div style=\"position:absolute; bottom:-2px; left:33.33%; width:2px; height:8px; background:#333;\"></div>\n        <div style=\"position:absolute; bottom:-2px; left:66.66%; width:2px; height:8px; background:#333;\"></div>\n        <div style=\"position:absolute; bottom:-2px; right:0; width:2px; height:8px; background:#333;\"></div>\n        <div style=\"position:absolute; bottom:-22px; left:0; right:0; text-align:center; font-size:13px;\">全程84km</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"bubble bubble-green\" style=\"max-width:200px;\">\n      把全程平均分成3份，已经行了2份。\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"flex-row\" style=\"margin: 15px 0; align-items: center;\">\n    <div class=\"person-illustration\">\n      <div class=\"person-icon\">👧</div>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"flex:1;\">\n      <div class=\"solution-method\">\n        可以这样算：$84 \\div 3 \\times 2 = 56\\,(\\text{km})$\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"solution-method\">\n        也可以这样算：$84 \\times \\frac{2}{3} = 84 \\times \\frac{2}{3} = 56\\,(\\text{km})$\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"person-illustration\">\n      <div class=\"person-icon\">👦</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"answer-line\">\n    答：汽车已经行了 56km。当分数用来表示单位\"1\"的几分之几时，也可以叫做\"分率\"。\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"label-box\" style=\"display:block; text-align:center; margin:10px auto; width:fit-content;\">\n    单位\"1\" × 几分之几 = 几分之几对应的量\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"try-section\">\n    <span class=\"try-title\">议一议</span> \"$84 \\times \\frac{2}{3}$\" 这样列式，你是怎么想的？\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<hr class=\"section-divider\">\n\n<!-- Problem 2 -->\n<div class=\"problem-section\">\n  <div class=\"problem-title\">\n    <span class=\"problem-number green\">2</span>\n    <span class=\"problem-question\">张伯伯把20hm²土地的 $\\frac{3}{4}$ 用来种玫瑰，其中种红玫瑰的面积占玫瑰地面积的 $\\frac{3}{5}$，张伯伯种了多少公顷红玫瑰？</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"flex-row\" style=\"margin:10px 0; align-items:center;\">\n    <div style=\"flex:1;\">\n      <div class=\"explanation-text\" style=\"padding-left:0;\">\n        求一个数的几分之几是多少 &nbsp;→&nbsp; 连续求一个数的几分之几的问题\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"arrow-down\">↓</div>\n      <div class=\"label-box red\" style=\"display:block; text-align:center; margin:5px auto; width:fit-content;\">\n        用已知量连续乘分率\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"flex-row\" style=\"margin:15px 0; align-items:flex-start;\">\n    <div style=\"flex:1;\">\n      <div class=\"bubble\" style=\"max-width:200px; margin-bottom:10px;\">\n        题中的 $\\frac{3}{4}$ 表示什么意思？$\\frac{3}{5}$ 呢？\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"explanation-text\" style=\"padding-left:0; margin-top:10px;\">\n        $\\frac{3}{4}$ 表示把 20hm² 土地看作单位\"1\"，其中的 $\\frac{3}{4}$ 种玫瑰。\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"explanation-text\" style=\"padding-left:0;\">\n        $\\frac{3}{5}$ 表示把种玫瑰的土地看作单位\"1\"，其中的 $\\frac{3}{5}$ 种红玫瑰。\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div style=\"flex:1; text-align:center;\">\n      <div class=\"diagram-label\">20hm²土地</div>\n      <div class=\"grid-diagram\">\n        <div class=\"grid-row\">\n          <div class=\"grid-cell cross-shaded\"></div>\n          <div class=\"grid-cell cross-shaded\"></div>\n          <div class=\"grid-cell cross-shaded\"></div>\n          <div class=\"grid-cell cross-shaded\"></div>\n          <div class=\"grid-cell light-shaded\"></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"grid-row\">\n          <div class=\"grid-cell cross-shaded\"></div>\n          <div class=\"grid-cell cross-shaded\"></div>\n          <div class=\"grid-cell cross-shaded\"></div>\n          <div class=\"grid-cell cross-shaded\"></div>\n          <div class=\"grid-cell light-shaded\"></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"grid-row\">\n          <div class=\"grid-cell cross-shaded\"></div>\n          <div class=\"grid-cell cross-shaded\"></div>\n          <div class=\"grid-cell cross-shaded\"></div>\n          <div class=\"grid-cell cross-shaded\"></div>\n          <div class=\"grid-cell light-shaded\"></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"grid-row\">\n          <div class=\"grid-cell light-shaded\"></div>\n          <div class=\"grid-cell light-shaded\"></div>\n          <div class=\"grid-cell light-shaded\"></div>\n          <div class=\"grid-cell light-shaded\"></div>\n          <div class=\"grid-cell light-shaded\"></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex; align-items:center; gap:5px; margin-top:5px; justify-content:center; flex-wrap:wrap;\">\n        <span style=\"font-size:12px;\">20hm²土地的 $\\frac{3}{4}$ 种玫瑰</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"diagram-label\" style=\"margin-top:5px;\">玫瑰地的 $\\frac{3}{5}$ 种红玫瑰</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div style=\"flex:0.5;\">\n      <div class=\"bubble bubble-orange\" style=\"max-width:160px;\">\n        还可以怎样解决？\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"person-illustration\" style=\"margin-top:20px;\">\n        <div class=\"person-icon\">👧</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"solution-method\" style=\"text-align:center; margin:15px 0;\">\n    $20 \\times \\frac{3}{4} \\times \\frac{3}{5} = 9\\,(\\text{hm}^2)$\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"answer-line text-center\">\n    答：张伯伯种了 9hm² 红玫瑰。\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<!-- Bottom note -->\n<div class=\"note-box\">\n  <strong>注意：</strong>分数连乘问题中最基本的数量关系式：单位\"1\"的量 × 分率 = 分率的对应量。准确地找出单位\"1\"的关键在于明确题目中\"哪个量是（或占、相当于）哪个量的几分之几\"，那个量的几分之几，那个量就是单位\"1\"。\n  <span class=\"panda-icon\">🐼</span>\n</div>\n\n</body>\n</html>",
